Replaces: transmission-gtk
Description: Transmission, the BitTorrent client (GTK interface), built on Qt
 Transmission is a BitTorrent client. This package builds its unmodified
 GTK interface against GTK made Qt: it runs as a Qt application without GTK.
 .
 transmission-common has the application icons; transmission-cli and
 transmission-daemon the remote control, the daemon and the web interface.
